Z||000002||ChadMan||07-15-99||07:02 AM||||The clear fluid is probably windshield washer fluid.  Both of my Fieros leak a little washer fluid onto the base of the windshield during hard right turns such as freeway onramps.<p>As for paint/value, unless you have a rare factory color like blue (1987), yellow (1988), or Indy Pace Car, I think a good aftermarket paint job will probably increase your car's value.
